## Ringkasan Fitur CRUD

| Resource | Create | Read | Update | Delete |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| **Data Ibu** | ✅ onboarding | ✅ load saat buka | ✅ edit form | ✅ tombol hapus |
| **Data Anak** | ✅ onboarding | ✅ load saat buka | ✅ edit form | ✅ tombol hapus |
| **Growth Record** | ✅ form antropometri | ✅ list di grafik | ✅ edit dari history | ✅ delete dari history |
| **Imunisasi** | ✅ sudah ada | ✅ dari API real | ✅ update status | – |
| **User Session** | ✅ register/login | ✅ auto-login | – | ✅ logout |

